<title>USA: Intimate Brands sees '96 earnings up 20 pct.</title>
<headline>Intimate Brands sees '96 earnings up 20 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intimate Brands Inc said Thursday that its 1996 earnings are expected to grow about 20 percent from 1995, while third quarter earnings should be up 22 percent and fourth quarter earnings should increase about 20 percent.</p>
<p>In the next five years, Intimate Brands said, it expects its earnings to more than double -- a growth rate that Chairman and Chief Executive Leslie Wexner said reflects &quot;a prudent balance of growth and risk that is deliverable.&quot;</p>
</text>
